{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:36:35+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T06:36:35+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Accelleron Industries AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"Switzerland","city":"Baden","website":"https://accelleron.com","employees":3046,"summary":"Accelleron Industries AG designs, manufactures, sells, and services turbochargers, fuel injection equipment, and digital solutions for heavy-duty applications. The company operates in two segments, Medium & Low Speed and High Speed. Its products are used in electric power generation, such as gas-fired engines for base load power, combined heat and power, balancing power, and back-up power; and onshore oil and gas, including gas-fired engines driving compressor stations for gas pipelines, as well as in marine and off-highway applications. The company has operations in Asia, the Middle East, Africa, Japan, China, the Americas, the United States, Europe, and Switzerland. Accelleron Industries AG was founded in 1924 and is headquartered in Baden, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"Accelleron Industries AG conçoit, fabrique, vend et entretient des turbocompresseurs, des équipements d'injection de carburant et des solutions numériques pour les applications lourdes. La société opère dans deux segments, Medium & Low Speed et High Speed. Ses produits sont utilisés dans la production d'énergie électrique, tels que les moteurs au gaz pour la puissance de charge de base, la chaleur et la puissance combinées, la puissance d'équilibrage et la puissance de secours; et le pétrole et le gaz terrestres, y compris les moteurs au gaz entraînant des stations de compression pour les gazoducs, ainsi que dans les applications marines et hors route."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":6075387392,"shares_outstanding":940462